    description "The Sisters Of Mercy Stafford Bingley Hall ( Futurama 3 festival) 5/09/1981 Teachers/Adrenochrome .Facebook group The Sisters Of mercy 1980.1985 period : https://www.facebook.com/groups/1704379173138423/ .&#10;My main interest as a Sisters fan is listening to their music from the early 80s, so I'm always on the lookout for live recordings or other items which I don't already have, or better quality versions of those I do already own. I'm always happy to trade, but if you're not into swapping or if you don't have the time to make copies of old TSOM live tapes, I'd be happy to make a digital copy from your original and send it back along with a digital copy for you too. If you have any old TSOM live audio cassettes which you no longer want or need,I'd be happy to buy them off you at a good price (or make a donation to a charity of your choice, if you don't want to take money). There are too many old Sisters live tapes literally rotting away in garages and attics .&#10;Mail contact : Spiggytapes@free.fr."
