    id 157
    label "i9WI4Y3LohM"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-26T17:45:46Z"
    title "ADRENOCHROME - I got you in my soul"
    description "Lyric video for Adrenochrome - I got you in my soul&#10;&#10;Adrenochrome is an essence, a state of mind, a choice, to play and create exciting and passionate music.&#10;In early 2019 Alfio Caracciolo (Drums) called Mattia Maniezzo (Bass) and Simone Romanato (Voice and guitar) to let them hear a few tracks he made. After a few listening to his tracks, the very next month they joined the band, they rolled up their sleeves and they became: Adrenochrome.&#10;&#10;Influenced by Queen, The Darkness, Muse and many other,&#10;they eat and drink music every moment they breathe,  because for them, Rock 'n' roll is not dead.&#10;&#10;PLEASE SUBSCRIBE TO STAY UPDATED&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US ON: &#10;https://www.instagram.com/adrenochromeofficialband/&#10;https://open.spotify.com/album/5ensJ3N1cG2IRviQRntnfK&#10;http://itunes.apple.com/album/id1612417510?ls=1&#38;app=itunes&#10;http://itunes.apple.com/album/id/1612417510&#10;&#10;LYRICS&#10;That&#8217;s not that easy,&#10;To find someone like you,&#10;I know your intentions should be good,&#10;but you know I&#8217;m not a fool.&#10;&#10;Ain&#8217;t that crazy,&#10;To try out what will going on,&#10;I feel it in my bones.&#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;but I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;&#10;That Sunday night, you told me something, I saw something,&#10;But shit, I felt so blind,&#10;Maybe you were worried, to fuck my feelings up,&#10;I&#8217;m too weak now to face that.&#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;But I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;But I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;&#10;You are, only you, are only&#10;There&#8217;s no guilty in this room,&#10;But you are, you pretend I was a loo.&#10;To take a shit, a piss, and mixing the bulshit we sad before.&#10;Kick me like a fucking ball,&#10;you know I can&#8217;t stand this anymore!&#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;But I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;But I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;Ah.&#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;But I got you in my soul.&#10;I don&#8217;t want you, I don&#8217;t need you,&#10;I gotta take it slow"
